{
  "name": "456. A Replicate prediction with no URL to poll is an empty result, not a crash (replicate empty prediction)",
  "description": "Pins TXE-7056. Local fixture regression, no live provider calls: start tests/e2e/api/runners/provider-error-fixture.mjs, start an isolated gateway on tests/e2e/api/provider_config/provider-error-fixture.config.json and run with providerErrorFixture=1; every case is skipped otherwise. The replicate provider's base is the fixture's /pp/replicate, which accepts every prediction create with 201 and a body that is not finished and names no urls.get. Before the change the provider dereferenced the missing urls in the request worker and the gateway process died, Rows 2 to 6: each of the five routes whose Replicate operation polls a prediction (/v1/images/generations, /v1/chat/completions, /v1/completions, /v1/responses, /v1/images/edits as a multipart form) returns 502 provider_empty_result. Row 7: the fixture saw one create per request and no poll. Row 8: the gateway still answers. Before the change the gateway process died on row 2 and every later row failed to connect.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "456.1 reset the fixture's record (replicate empty prediction)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{providerErrorFixtureUrl}}/__reset"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('the fixture reset its record', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "456.2 [EXPECT-502] replicate/owner/model POST /v1/images/generations: a prediction accepted with no urls is an empty result (replicate empty prediction)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"replicate/owner/model\",\n  \"prompt\": \"a paper boat on a pond\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/images/generations",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "images",
            "generations"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.variables.get('providerErrorFixture') !== '1') {",
              "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('an accepted prediction with no URL to poll is 502 provider_empty_result', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(502);",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.is_bifrost_error, pm.response.text()).to.eql(false);",
              "  pm.expect(j.extra_fields && j.extra_fields.error_type, 'error_type: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('provider_empty_result');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
